# Copy this file to app/secrets.local.env (already gitignored -- never
# commit the real one) and fill in your own Gemini API key from
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey.
#
# Before shipping this key in a release build, set a hard request quota
# (not just a budget alert) on the Generative Language API for its GCP
# project, and restrict the key to that API only -- see
# releases/CHANGELOG.md for the full rationale. Anyone who has the built
# APK can, with effort, extract this key from the binary; the quota/
# restriction is what actually limits the damage, not secrecy.

GEMINI_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
